# Ruby version for the fastlane toolchain. Read by mise, asdf and rbenv.
#
# 3.4 because fastlane 2.240 does not run on Ruby 4: it raises a NameError
# inside its own CLI dispatcher before any lane is reached, so a machine
# following the previous pin could not run a single lane. Verified here rather
# than assumed — `bundle exec fastlane lint` runs on this version and does not
# on 4.0.5.
#
# What matters beyond that is only that everyone and every CI image agrees on
# one version. Raise it when fastlane supports the next one, not before.
ruby 3.4.10
